msgstr "Ntinye Oghere Akpaaka"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Tinye oghere na ederede ka nkọwa eserese na data eserese wee dịrị n'otu ahịrị mgbe niile. Rịba ama: nke a nwere ike ime ka eserese were ogologo oge iji gosipụta n'ihi nnukwu ibu ọrụ. Ọzọkwa, Ntinye Oghere Akpaaka nwere ike ghara izi ezi n'ụdị eserese niile, itinye aha kwụsiri ike na-enyekarị aka."

