msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Ụzọ Mmepụta Eserese/Isi Iyi Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na e debere ya na Dị Mfe, enwere ike imepụta Eserese na Isi Iyi Data naanị site na Eserese Ọhụrụ. Ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ Nke Ka Elu, a na-akwado mmepụta Eserese na Isi Iyi Data nke ochie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Dị Mfe"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Nke Ka Elu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Gosi Enyemaka Fọọmụ/Ntọala n'Ahịrị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, a ga-egosi Enyemaka Fọọmụ na Ntọala n'ahịrị. Ma ọ bụghị ya, a ga-egosipụta ya mgbe a nọ n'elu bọtịnụ enyemaka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Enyemaka Ihu Akwụkwọ Nke Obodo Naanị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Site na ndabara, enyemaka ihu akwụkwọ Cacti dị na docs.cacti.net. Agbanyeghị, ọ bụrụ na sistemụ gị enweghị ohere ịntanetị, ị nwere ike ibudata akwụkwọ nduzi ahụ na kọmputa gị n'ụdị HTML ma debe ya n'ebe 'docs' nke sava Cacti gị. Ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ naanị iji ebe obodo maka akwụkwọ enyemaka ihu akwụkwọ, tụọ igbe nlele a akara."

#: include/global_settings.php
