msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, a ga-eduzi mbọ ọ bụla ịbanye na Cacti gaa na HTTPS iji hụ na e nwere nchekwa dị elu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Nchedo JavaScript N'ahịrị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Ọ na-achịkwa otu Content-Security-Policy si egbochi JavaScript dị n'ime ahịrị. HTMX na-edobe iwu 'unsafe-inline' nke isiokwu na ngwa mgbakwunye niile dị ugbu a na-adabere na ya ma dakọọ n'omume nke mbipụta ndị gara aga. Mbufe Nonce na-ewepụta iwu nonce siri ike na ọnọdụ mkpesa naanị ka e wee nwee ike ịchọpụta script isi na nke ngwa mgbakwunye na-adabaghị n'emebighị UI. Mmachi Nonce na-egbochi script na-enweghị nonce arịrịọ ma chọọ ka CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE bụrụ eziokwu na include/config.php; na-enweghị mgbochi ahụ doro anya ọ na-anọgide n'ọnọdụ mkpesa naanị n'enweghị nsogbu. Enweghị na-enyekwa ohere oku eval() adịghị nchebe ma bụrụ nhọrọ kacha nwee obere mgbochi."

