msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Nke Ndabere)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Mbufe Nonce (Mkpesa Naanị)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Mmachi Nonce (Ọkwa Elu)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI Mkpesa Mmegide CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "A na-eji ya n'ọnọdụ Mbufe Nonce na Mmachi Nonce. URL ebe ihe nchọgharị na-ezipụ mkpesa mmegide Content-Security-Policy. Hapụ ya n'efu iji njikwa csp_report.php ejikọtara n'okpuru ụzọ URL Cacti ahaziri."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Isi Iyi Ndị Ọzọ nke Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Aha ngalaba ndị oghere kewara nke a ga-ekwe ka a nweta n'èzí Sava Webụ n'onwe ya. Nke a dị mkpa maka ndị ọrụ na-ahọrọ iji CDN, ma ọ bụ saịtị nnabata. Isi iyi nwere ike ịgụnye kaadị ọhịa dịka: *.mydomain.com, ma ọ bụ usoro nkwukọrịta, dịka: https://*.example.com. Isi Iyi Ndị Ọzọ a gụnyere naanị ụdị Onyonyo, CSS na JavaScript."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Gbanye htmx maka mmelite nzacha n'otu ebe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Mgbe agbanyere ya, a na-etinye ihe nbudata htmx ka ibe ndị họọrọ ya wee nwee ike imegharị nsonaazụ nzacha ha n'ebugharịghị ibe ahụ dum ọzọ. Gbanyụọ naanị ma ọ bụrụ na ngwa mgbakwunye na-arụ ọrụ n'ụzọ na-ezighị ezi."

