msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Mgbe ị na-eji ọtụtụ Ndị Na-anakọta Data, ndị a bụ Ntọala maka Nkwukọrịta n'etiti Ndị Na-anakọta Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Ọnụ ụzọ TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Ọnụ ụzọ TCP eji enwe nkwukọrịta na Ndị Na-anakọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya. Usoro nkwukọrịta ga-adakọ na sava webụ Etiti Cacti (ma ọ bụ HTTP ma ọ bụ HTTPS). Hapụ ya n'efu iji ọnụ ụzọ ndabere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Oge, na sekọnd, nke sava webụ Etiti Cacti ga-echere azịza site n'aka Onye Na-anakọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya iji nweta ozi Ngwaọrụ dị iche iche tupu ọ hapụ arịrịọ ahụ. Na Ngwaọrụ ndị jikọtara na Ndị Na-anakọta Data ndị ọzọ na-abụghị Onye Na-anakọta Data Etiti Cacti, a ga-ejiriri Onye Nnọchiteanya Dị N'ebe Dị Anya chịkọta ozi Ngwaọrụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Nyochaa Asambodo TLS nke Onye Nnọchiteanya Dị N'ebe Dị Anya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Chọọ asambodo a tụkwasịrị obi nke aha ya dakọtara na aha nnabata nke Onye Na-anakọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya. Gbanyụọ naanị mgbe ị na-edochi asambodo ochie ejiri aka bịanye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Mba (Asambodo Ochie Ejiri Aka Bịanye)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Faịlụ CA nke Onye Nnọchiteanya Dị N'ebe Dị Anya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke nhọrọ gaa na ngwugwu PEM CA eji enyocha asambodo Onye Na-anakọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya. Hapụ ya n'efu iji ụlọ nchekwa ntụkwasị obi sistemụ PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Ọkwa Ndekọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Ọkwa ndekọ maka ọrụ Akpaaka. Ọkwa ndị ahụ bụ Obere, Ọkara na Elu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Manye Nyocha Akpaaka N'usoro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Mgbe agbanyere ya, Cacti Akpaaka ga-enyocha otu netwọk n'otu oge ọ bụghị n'otu mgbe ahụ. Ntọala a nwere ike ịba uru mgbe Sava Webụ Cacti gị nwere obere isi nhazi maka ime nyocha Akpaaka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Gbanye Mmepụta Eserese Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Mgbe agbanyụrụ ya, Cacti Akpaaka agaghị emepụta Eserese ọ bụla n'onwe ya. Nke a bara uru mgbe ị na-edozi ntọala Ngwaọrụ iji zere imepụta Eserese ọhụrụ oge ọ bụla i chekwara ihe. Ịkpọ Iwu Akpaaka n'aka ka ga-ekwe omume."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Gbanye Mmepụta Ihe Osisi Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Mgbe agbanyụrụ ya, Cacti Akpaaka agaghị emepụta Ihe Osisi ọ bụla n'onwe ya. Nke a bara uru mgbe ị na-edozi ntọala Ngwaọrụ ma ọ bụ Eserese iji zere imepụta Ntinye Osisi ọhụrụ oge ọ bụla i chekwara ihe. Ịkpọ Iwu n'aka ka ga-ekwe omume."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Email Ebe A Na-ezipụ Ọkwa Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Adreesị Email a ga-ezigara Email Ọkwa Akpaaka ma ọ bụrụ na akọwaghị ya n'ọkwa Netwọk Akpaaka. Ọ bụrụ na ahapụrụ oghere a, ma ọ bụ uru Netwọk Akpaaka n'efu, Cacti ga-eji akaụntụ Email Ndị Nchịkwa Isi nke Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
