#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMPv3 Privacy Passphrase for all new Devices."
msgstr "Okwuntụghe Nzuzo SNMP v3 ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the SNMP v3 Context for all new Devices."
msgstr "Tinye Okirikiri (Context) SNMP v3 maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP v3 Engine Id for all new Devices. Leave this field empty to use the SNMP Engine ID being defined per SNMPv3 Notification receiver."
msgstr "Engine ID SNMP v3 ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile. Hapụ ubi a ka ọ tọgbọ chakoo iji jiri SNMP Engine ID a kọwapụtara maka onye nnata ọkwa SNMPv3 ọ bụla."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Port Number"
msgstr "Nọmba Port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default UDP Port for all new Devices.  Typically 161."
msgstr "Port UDP ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile.  Ọ na-abụkarị 161."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Oge njedebe SNMP ndabara na mili-sekọnd maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a positive integer (milliseconds)."
msgstr "ga-abụrịrị ọnụọgụgụ zuru ezu dị mma (mili-sekọnd)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be between {{ min }} and {{ max }}."
msgstr "ga-adịrịrị n'etiti {{ min }} na {{ max }}."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Nnwa ọzọ SNMP ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "ga-abụrịrị ọnụọgụgụ zuru ezu na-abụghị nke na-adịghị mma."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Omume SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Agbanyere Nkwado SNMP Agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na akaa nhọrọ a, Cacti ga-ejupụta tebụl SNMP Agent na ozi ngwaọrụ na sistemụ Cacti.  Ọ naghị agbanye SNMP Agent n'onwe ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Gbanye MD5 na DES maka SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Algọridim nkwenye MD5 na nke nzuzo DES bụ ndị ochie, adịghị ike, ma adịghị na nrụnye PHP na Net-SNMP e wusiri ike (FIPS).  Mgbe agbanyụrụ ya, a na-ewepụ MD5 na DES na ndepụta Usoro Nkwenye na Nzuzo SNMPv3 nke na-egosi mgbe a na-edezi Ngwaọrụ nakwa na Nhọrọ SNMP Automation, na-ahapụ naanị algọridim SHA na AES siri ike karị."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Gbanye Ebe Nchekwa Nzuzo (Credential Cache)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Kwadoo ma chekwaa arụmụka nzuzo SNMPv3 otu ugboro maka mgbanwe nzuzo ọ bụla ka usoro poller ọ bụla nwee ike iji ha mee ihe ọzọ kama ịrụgharị ha na arịrịọ ọ bụla.  Nke a na-eweta obere nchekwa mgbe a na-anakọta na nzuzo SNMPv3 site na faịlụ Net-SNMP.  Mgbatị php-snmp na-ahụ maka ọtụtụ SNMPv3 gets n'ime usoro ma na-agafe ebe nchekwa a, mana a ka na-eji faịlụ Net-SNMP (ya na ebe nchekwa a) maka SNMP walks, mpụta hex, arịrịọ na-esetịpụ context ma ọ bụ engine id, na njikọta usoro nke ụdị PHP na-agba ọsọ anaghị akwado.  Gbanye nke a ma ọ bụrụ na ị na-anakọta nke ọ bụla n'ime ọrụ ndị ahụ na nzuzo SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max OID Limit"
msgstr "Oke OID Kachasị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ kachasị ndabara nke SNMP Get OIDs a ga-ewepụta maka arịrịọ snmpget ọ bụla.  Maka Ngwaọrụ, a na-achịkwa ntọala a na ọkwa Ngwaọrụ.  I kwesịrị iji ntọala a naanị mgbe ị na-eji SNMP API nke Cacti n'onwe ya na skripụtụ ma ọ bụ plọgịn gị."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ogo Nwetaghachi Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "OID ole ka e kwesịrị iweghachi n'otu arịrịọ snmpbulkwalk?  Maka Ngwaọrụ nwere osisi SNMP buru ibu, ịbawanye nha a ga-eme ka arụmọrụ nhazigharị ndepụta dịkwuo mma n'elu WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Gbanyụọ Nlele OID Na-abawanye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Na-achịkwa igbanyụ nlele maka OID na-abawanye mgbe a na-agafe osisi OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Ịdị Njikere/Ịdị Iru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Ịdị Njikere/Ịdị Iru nke ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile.  Ụzọ Cacti ga-eji chọpụta ma Ngwaọrụ dị njikere maka nyocha data.  <br><i>RỊBA AMA: A na-atụ aro ka, na nke kacha nta, a họrọ SNMP mgbe niile.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device SNMP Recovery Options Retry Frequency"
msgstr "Ugboro Nnwaleghachi nke Nhọrọ Mgbake SNMP maka Ngwaọrụ Dara Ada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When a Device is Down, and has an SNMP Recovery Options Set established, how often do you wish to try to retry the Device using the SNMP Options Set specified?"
msgstr "Mgbe Ngwaọrụ Dara Ada, ma nwee Ntọala Nhọrọ Mgbake SNMP e hiwere, ugboro ole ka ị chọrọ ịnwa ịnwaleghachi Ngwaọrụ ahụ site n'iji Ntọala Nhọrọ SNMP a kapịrị ọnụ?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Ụdị Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Ụdị Ping nke ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Ọdụ Ping nke ndabara maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile.  Site na TCP, Cacti ga-anwa iziga Syn na ọdụ ahụ.  Site na UDP, Cacti chọrọ njikọ gara nke ọma, ma ọ bụ njehie 'enweghị ike iru ọdụ' iji chọpụta ma Ngwaọrụ ahụ na-arụ ọrụ ma ọ bụ na ọ naghị arụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ Oge Nkwụsị Ping nke ndabara na mili-sekọnd maka Ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ niile.  Ọnụọgụgụ oge nkwụsị a ga-eji maka ịme ping SNMP, ICMP, UDP na TCP nke Ngwaọrụ.  A ga-agbakọta Ping ICMP ruo sekọnd kacha nso.  Usoro arụmọrụ na-achịkwa oge nkwụsị njikọ TCP na UDP na Windows, yabụ a naghị atụ aro ha na Windows."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Ugboro ole Cacti ga-anwa ime ping na Ngwaọrụ tupu ọ kaa ya akara dị ka nke dara ada."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Up/Down Settings"
msgstr "Ntọala Ịrụ Ọrụ/Ịda Ada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failure Count"
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ Ọdịda"

