#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Ụdị Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Ụdị poller a ga-eji.  Ntọala a ga-amalite ịrụ ọrụ n'oge nchịkọta ọzọ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Oge nchịkọta a na-eji ugbu a.  Ntọala a ga-emetụta ugboro ole a na-elele ma na-emelite RRDfile.  <strong><u>RỊBA AMA: Ọ bụrụ na ị gbanwee uru a, ị ga-emejupụta ebe nchekwa poller ọzọ.  Ịghara ime nke a nwere ike ibute mfu data.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "abụghị nhọrọ ziri ezi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Oge Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ugboro ole a ga-amalite onye nchịkọta data Cacti.  Ị nwere ike iji crontab, ọrụ ahaziri oge (maka windows), ma ọ bụ ọrụ cactid systemd iji chịkwaa mmalite onye nchịkọta data Cacti.  Maka ntuziaka maka iji cactid daemon, lelee faịlụ README.md dị na ndekọ service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Hazie Ibu Usoro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ nhọrọ a, Cacti ga-anwa ime ka ibu nke usoro poller ọ bụla hara nhata site n'ikesa ihe poller n'otu nha n'usoro ọ bụla."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Obosara Mpụta Nchọpụta Mperi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ nhọrọ a, Cacti ga-elele maka mpụta karịrị ike Cacti nwere ichekwa ya ma wepụta ịdọ aka ná ntị mgbe ọ hụrụ ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Nkwụsị Oge Onye Nnọchiteanya Dịpụrụ Adịpụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Melite Tebụl Poller N'okirikiri Ọ Bụla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ntọala a bụ maka sistemụ nwere naanị otu poller iji wughachi tebụl mpụta poller n'okirikiri nchịkọta ọ bụla iji gbochie tebụl ebe nchekwa ịgbanwe gaa na swap na nnukwu sistemụ nwere nnukwu nchekwa data nwere ike iji swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Mkpụgharị Onye Nchịkọta Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Oge Mmekọrịta Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Oge mmekọrịta nchịkọta ndabere a ga-eji mgbe ị na-eke poller.  Ntọala a ga-emetụta ugboro ole a na-elele ma na-emelite poller ndị dịpụrụ adịpụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Gbanyụọ Mkpụgharị Ebe Nchekwa Akụrụngwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Nke ndabara, isi Onye Nchịkọta Data Cacti ga-echekwa weebụsaịtị dum na ngwa mgbakwunye n'ime Nchekwa Akụrụngwa. Mgbe ahụ, site n'oge ruo n'oge, Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya ga-emelitere onwe ha site na mmelite ọ bụla sitere n'isi Onye Nchịkọta Data Cacti. Nchekwa Akụrụngwa a na-enyere Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya aka ịkwalite onwe ha. Ọ bụrụ na ị chọghị iji nhọrọ a, ị nwere ike gbanyụọ ya site na ntọala a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Gbanyụọ Mmekọrịta Zuru Ezu Akpaaka Mgbe A Na-akwalite"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Nke ndabara, mgbe a kwalitechara usoro Isi Cacti, ọ ga-eme Mmekọrịta Zuru Ezu nye Ndị Nchịkọta Data niile. Usoro a nwere ike were oge. Ya mere, iji mee ka nkwalite gwụchaa ngwa ngwa, anyị na-enye nhọrọ a. Rịba ama na ọ bụrụ na e gbanyụrụ nke a, onye nchịkwa Cacti ga-amanye usoro a site na ihu Ndị Nchịkọta Data mgbe nkwalite gasịrị."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Ntọala Ndị Ọzọ nke Onye Nchịkọta Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ndekọ Data Na-ezighị Ezi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Kedu otu ị ga-achọ ka e dee ndekọ mperi mmepụta nke Onye Nchịkọta Data? Nhọrọ gụnyere: 'Nkọwa Zuru Ezu' nke na-akọwapụta mperi ọ bụla, 'Nchịkọta' nke na-enye ọnụọgụ mperi mmepụta maka Ngwaọrụ ọ bụla, yana 'Ọ dịghị', nke na-adịghị enye ọnụọgụ mperi."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Nchịkọta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Nkọwa Zuru Ezu"

