#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụ usoro sava skriptị na-agba n'otu oge maka usoro spine ọ bụla. A na-anabata ntọala dị n'etiti 1 na 15. Ntọala a ga-enyere aka ma ọ bụrụ na ị na-agba ọtụtụ eriri na skriptị sava skriptị ma ọ bara uru naanị maka Onye Nchịkọta Data spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Uru Oge Nkwụsị nke Skriptị na Sava Skriptị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Oge kachasị nke spine ga-echere ka skriptị gwụchaa. Uru oge nkwụsị a dị na sekọnd ma dị irè maka ma Ndị Nchịkọta Data cmd.php ma spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Nkwụsịtụ Mgbasa Mmepụta Poller Adịghị Efù"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị na-enwe nsogbu na ụfọdụ isi iyi data, ịdọ aka ná ntị 'Mmepụta Poller Adịghị Efù' nwere ike jupụta Email gị. Ọ bụrụ na nke a na-eme, ị nwere ike belata mgbasa ozi ntọala a dabere na oge etiti a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Ntinyegharị Ndepụta Ngwaọrụ Niile Oge Ụfọdụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Nhazi Oge Ntinyegharị Ndepụta Ngwaọrụ Niile"

#: include/global_settings.php
