msgstr "Oge kachasị skriptị Nyocha RRDfile nke Cacti nwere ike ịgba n'emepụtaghị mperi oge nkwụsị na n'akwụsịghị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "Awa %s"

