msgstr "Kwado Mmelite RRD Mgbe Achọrọ Ya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Boost ọ kwesịrị ịkwado mmelite RRD mgbe achọrọ ya na Cacti? Ọ bụrụ na ị gbanyụọ ya, mgbanwe a agaghị amalite ịrụ ọrụ ruo mgbe usoro nchịkọta ọzọ gasịrị. Mgbe ị nwere Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya, a chọrọ ka ntọala a gbanye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Ngwa Mmelite RRD nke Ọkwa Sistemụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Tupu e nwee ike ikpochapụ Mmelite RRD Mgbe Achọrọ Ya, ọsọ poller ga-agabigarịrị mgbe niile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Ugboro Ole Ka Boost Kwesịrị Imelite RRD Niile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Mgbe ị kwadoro Boost, a na-emelite faịlụ RRD gị naanị mgbe onye ọrụ rịọrọ ha, ma ọ bụ mgbe oge a gafere."

