msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ usoro ọrụ Boost na-arụkọ ọrụ n'otu oge a ga-eji hazie RRD niile dị na tebụl Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Ndekọ Kachasị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na tebụl mmepụta Boost gafee nha a, na ndekọ, mmelite ga-eme."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Ihe Isi Iyi Data Kachasị N'otu Ngafe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Iji kwalite arụmọrụ, ngwa mmelite RRD nke Boost kwesịrị ịma ole Ihe Isi Iyi Data ekwesịrị iweghachite n'otu ngafe. Biko kpachara anya ka ị ghara itinye ya elu nke ukwuu n'ihi na arụmọrụ eserese n'oge nnukwu mmelite nwere ike ịda mbà. Ọ bụrụ na ị hụ nwayọ na eserese ma ọ bụ nchịkọta n'oge mmelite, belata nọmba a. Ọnụahịa ndabere bụ 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Ogologo Arụmụka Kachasị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Mgbe Boost na-eziga iwu mmelite na RRDtool, ọ gaghị agafe Ogologo Arụmụka Kachasị nke sistemụ arụmọrụ. Nke a na-adị iche site na sistemụ arụmọrụ na ọkwa kernel. Dịka ọmụmaatụ: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ enweghị oke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Oke Ebe Nchekwa maka Boost na Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ ebe nchekwa kachasị maka Cacti Poller na Poller nke Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Oge Ọsọ Skript Mmelite RRD Kachasị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na poller Boost gafee oge ọsọ a, a ga-etinye ịdọ aka na ntị na ndekọ Cacti,"

