#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na nsogbu adapụta, a na-atụ aro nke ukwuu ka ị hichapụ cache ihe nchọgharị gị, mechie ma meghee ihe nchọgharị gị ọzọ (ọ bụghị naanị taabụ Cacti dị na ya) ma nwaa ọzọ, tupu ị kọọrọ The Cacti Group nsogbu ahụ"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "N'oge ụfọdụ na-adịghị adịkarị, anyị anatala akụkọ site n'aka ndị ọrụ na-enwe obere nsogbu n'ihi mgbanwe dị na koodu.  Nsogbu ndị a na-esite n'ihe nchọgharị ijigide koodu tupu nkwalite ma ọ bụ ezie na anyị ewerela nzọụkwụ iji belata ohere nke a, ọ ka nwere ike ime.  Ọ bụrụ na ị chọrọ ntụziaka gbasara otu esi ehichapụ cache ihe nchọgharị gị, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> bụ ezigbo ebe ị ga-esi malite."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na mgbe i hichapụrụ cache gị ma malitegharịa ihe nchọgharị gị, ị ka na-enwe nsogbu, biko kọọrọ anyị nsogbu ahụ ma anyị ga-agbalị ịchọpụta ihe kpatara ya."

