#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ngwaọrụ gị chọrọ ka e buru ụzọ jiri nhọrọ dị iche, ị nwere ike ịkọwa ha n'okpuru ma a ga-eji ha mee ihe tupu nke ndabere"

