msgstr "NNUKWU NJỌ: Usoro mwepụ 'fill' chọrọ nkọwapụta nke ụbọchị ma ọ bụ akara oge mmalite na njedebe."

#: lib/spikekill.php
msgid "FATAL: The 'absolute' removal method requires the specification of a start and end date or timestamp."
msgstr "NNUKWU NJỌ: Usoro mwepụ 'absolute' chọrọ nkọwapụta nke ụbọchị ma ọ bụ akara oge mmalite na njedebe."

