#: login_providers.php
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Njikọ"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Seva (ndị seva)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Ndepụta aha DNS host maọbụ adreesị IP e ji ohere kewaa maka seva LDAP dị irè. Cacti ga-anwa iji seva LDAP ndị ahụ site n'aka ekpe gaa n'aka nri iji kwado onye ọrụ.<br><br>Maka nbanye Okwuntụghe Otu Oge (OTP/MFA), ejila ndepụta ọtụtụ seva e ji ohere kewaa. Mgbe njikọ (bind) dara, Cacti na-agafe na seva na-esote ma jikọọ ọzọ site n'iji otu nzere ahụ, a ga-ajụkwa koodu otu oge e jirila. Kama nke ahụ, tinye otu aha DNS siri ike nke ihe nhazi ibu DNS (VIP) na-eche n'ihu ka e wee jikwaa mgbanwe seva n'okpuru Cacti ma mee naanị otu njikọ nkwenye."

