msgstr "Kpochapụ Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Nhọrọ menu a ga-ekpochapụ Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data niile dị na Nchekwa Data. Ọ bụrụ na agbanyere Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data, Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data ga-amalite nchịkọta ọzọ n'ọrụ Onye Nchịkọta Data na-abịa."

