#: utilities.php
msgid "This shows all objects being handled by the SNMP Agent."
msgstr "Nke a na-egosi ihe niile Onye Nnọchiteanya SNMP na-ahụ maka ha."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild SNMP Agent Cache"
msgstr "Rụgharịa Nchekwa Onye Nnọchiteanya SNMP"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "A ga-ekpochapụ nchekwa SNMP ma mepụta ya ọzọ ma ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ nhọrọ a. Rịba ama na ọ na-ewe ọsọ poller ọzọ iji weghachi nchekwa SNMP kpamkpam."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view the latest events SNMP Agent has handled in relation to the registered notification receivers."
msgstr "Nhọrọ menu a na-enye gị ohere ilele ihe omume kachasị ọhụrụ Onye Nnọchiteanya SNMP rụrụ n'ihe metụtara ndị na-anata ọkwa edebanyere aha."

